        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Across the top the alphabet and numbers. Below, various flowers, a rectangle bearing animals, a tree and blossoms. The lower half divided into rectangular areas bearing chevron motifs worked in various stitches. Polychrome silk yarns on linen ground. Condition good; black rotted out in spots.  Stitches:  Florentine, rococo, tent, two-sided Italian cross, upright gobelin, slanting gobelin."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/ca260ee0-6d2a-30cf-a78e-14e9c6f3bce0> ;
